                <l xml:id="m-51c5cd30-a64d-478f-a51b-3d33c1f5a9b0" facs="#m-832ce677-de97-45e5-bf4f-ad37ab906c27" label="text-like">Ist Sunday of the Passion.</l><l xml:id="m-a5ee8c7f-38c0-4fff-b0b2-fca548d89f16" facs="#m-e18b1a29-d0bd-47bb-9eab-bb8b34f75f7c" label="ambiguous">570</l><l xml:id="m-361c2607-0d81-4349-8292-1c963e3b7346" facs="#m-8a7bec6d-c367-4a01-aef9-93857cd974f9" label="lyrics-like">et forti-tú- do mé¬ a. Ps. Emitte</l><l xml:id="m-2acc8100-860a-4276-ab03-332d090fc9aa" facs="#m-0ff357d2-61f2-4dff-9b43-aa9af443545f" label="lyrics-like">mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-46ef83a0-19ce-4456-a530-c19507ae8007" facs="#m-dd7ccf6e-77cc-4553-95e4-0921ffedbc1a" label="ambiguous">us,</l><l xml:id="m-8ac613bb-3f45-4a59-b019-4e7d46bb635d" facs="#m-86507e59-4f19-42ca-93b5-58f9a76422de" label="lyrics-like">lúcem tú-am, et ve-ri-tátem tú-am: *psa me deduxé¬</l><l xml:id="m-77da4aeb-9d8b-444c-9648-38105e08aa9b" facs="#m-06b7df77-6b42-4f40-9d47-4ac87edc8407" label="lyrics-like">runt, et adduxérunt in móntem sánctum tú-um, et in</l><l xml:id="m-6c87a364-7f36-48fe-8d28-4b727c594b34" facs="#m-a6dd1bf9-59b2-4f5f-a31b-783ed1a6af38" label="lyrics-like">Jú-di-ca.</l><l xml:id="m-66aa859a-da7d-49ac-bf12-6e0f704a6eb3" facs="#m-dd5a7c73-1f95-4114-9297-d89f5b3a0682" label="lyrics-like">taberná-cu-la tú-a.</l><l xml:id="m-28dd28ee-0f71-4fc4-ab60-1bbe7f77cd84" facs="#m-e0782e51-ef6d-4755-8b3d-d1025c10997e" label="lyrics-like">The Glória Pátri. is not said at the Introit from this day until Easter</l><l xml:id="m-9cc4f8cd-31fa-403c-b4ee-63ca6216fc66" facs="#m-0ad64e7b-d40f-42ab-a6d0-12c9a8973e75" label="lyrics-like">Sunday, except on Feasts. The Júdica me. is repeated up to ihe Psalm.</l><l xml:id="m-14e8f9d0-22ba-4a73-95f3-b7a9b46418ff" facs="#m-1d532c6e-8233-41d3-ac4c-78438a9652f3" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-5ed45123-6644-4933-95de-065edaa0d83a" facs="#m-56577154-e73a-4c4b-9527-73f9fab623ab" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, omnípotens Deus,! córpore; * et te servánte custodiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-cd86c1b2-505b-411a-a4fa-904007eec816" facs="#m-db231ae0-d98a-491d-b34f-4584cea3fa83" label="lyrics-like">L familiam tuam propitius réspi¬</l><l xml:id="m-71d0e5bf-228d-430e-be2a-b33adbbb4e44" facs="#m-f1a82be9-03e4-4292-9ef1-4779079bc1c2" label="lyrics-like">tur in mente. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2dbd2420-c930-465b-8e06-ac3934594d6f" facs="#m-c4fe0807-a90d-4108-96eb-dbc33dfc5ddb" label="lyrics-like">ce: t ut te largiénte regátur in</l><l xml:id="m-42735373-e837-4561-a8fd-c35c3b75c7d3" facs="#m-b8cfb1c0-02a4-4201-88a7-39ef5107ddd0" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae Leati Pauli Apostoli ad Hebraeos.</l><l xml:id="m-9482a8cb-23f1-4133-a26c-fe047891a82f" facs="#m-e70cbf78-09ad-4287-93bf-d7563d2813e7" label="ambiguous">9. 11.15.</l><l xml:id="m-fda2b7c9-c411-4528-812c-8bd6eedfa9fd" facs="#m-fa9eb415-ca4c-4030-acaf-dffb665f8b3d" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Christus assístens Pón-] guis Christi, qui per Spíritum San¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6f8cd28-6a73-4487-a10f-cdd498430ce0" facs="#m-97878ed4-3fec-4f2f-b41e-b3e4181f5a55" label="lyrics-like">tifex futurórum bonórum, per</l><l xml:id="m-6dc9799a-1e43-452b-b5b9-05dc88844a1f" facs="#m-7f5ed858-83da-4986-aea4-dc872b2de6a3" label="lyrics-like">ctum semetípsum óbtulit immacu¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f6cf413-9cc2-4e60-a295-6cd58ef649fc" facs="#m-4ecc3806-c222-449d-986d-f72d18408204" label="lyrics-like">ámplius et perféctius tabernáculum</l><l xml:id="m-4d55af5c-8ce0-46d9-b1ee-0918bbbd5f5a" facs="#m-020b8747-f0aa-483f-be61-b19520f0389e" label="lyrics-like">látum Deo, emundábit consciéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-d73c64c8-fa1a-4ef1-b84e-59a1a5ef7400" facs="#m-8ed30374-f429-4ac1-8f71-a345daca8958" label="lyrics-like">non manufàctum, id est, non huius</l><l xml:id="m-b1b5c026-68e1-40dc-a907-a7d747e584d8" facs="#m-5f1cd88c-239c-49b3-af45-92435b7d3cea" label="lyrics-like">nostram ab opéribus mórtuis, ad</l><l xml:id="m-122065bc-0642-409b-afe5-af434e098dd8" facs="#m-4b26c82a-bd55-4f87-b973-0fb387ccddcd" label="lyrics-like">creatiónis; neque per sánguinem</l><l xml:id="m-a94b80c7-b674-49ec-8c66-40cf63ea0d60" facs="#m-c16161c9-6fe0-48d1-a681-0f8d06db6d2c" label="lyrics-like">serviéndum Deo vivénti? Et ideo</l><l xml:id="m-294b0843-f8a0-4b89-96b3-fd98568b78a2" facs="#m-7626315e-917e-4f66-9060-ba353e1fc07a" label="lyrics-like">hircórum aut vitulórum, sed per</l><l xml:id="m-183d40e9-0070-4f38-b194-5a33f013fbbc" facs="#m-e1138f04-d14f-4e8f-adca-14323eaf0360" label="lyrics-like">novi testaménti mediátor est: ut</l><l xml:id="m-49d12b20-3ccb-405b-816d-f27706b80856" facs="#m-806636dc-dfd3-4b5c-aa32-80f33ceb16b4" label="lyrics-like">morte intercedénte, in redemptió¬</l><l xml:id="m-e05597eb-3444-4fd3-8fc8-6876d380e0a1" facs="#m-3f04fde0-35f4-411a-875b-619274aab3ca" label="lyrics-like">próprium sánguinem introivit semel</l><l xml:id="m-56960475-d2d2-4751-9b88-e3a1fea82160" facs="#m-d5f7653f-1d5f-42af-98fd-d47d2d3e341b" label="lyrics-like">in Sancta, aetérna redemptióne in¬</l><l xml:id="m-8600f5fc-6b6f-473c-9c4f-092687a7ebad" facs="#m-782b07b4-9232-40f7-bb0e-6e4b54eb0019" label="lyrics-like">nem eárum praevaricatiónum, quae</l><l xml:id="m-4d588696-d694-4b43-9402-5b79f4bff006" facs="#m-61c8b5d3-402e-431e-af35-a99991a958c3" label="lyrics-like">vénta. Si enim sanguis hircórum et</l><l xml:id="m-3496609f-1e4e-4924-8f23-18ff97b10d42" facs="#m-0a4c2ca6-d785-4666-a89c-820d99c11eeb" label="lyrics-like">erant sub prióri testaménto, repro¬</l><l xml:id="m-880d2c1b-4d03-4c03-a421-523fda80b870" facs="#m-aad265a2-7333-404d-9093-f7a5b7be9b23" label="lyrics-like">taurórum, et cinis vitulae aspérsus,</l><l xml:id="m-c812e2ea-c841-409d-94d7-8f1f8218750f" facs="#m-08d6137a-6b07-41b7-b00c-39951734fafe" label="lyrics-like">missiónem accípiant, qui vocáti</l><l xml:id="m-9c3c8bad-d6b6-4336-bea8-1d339612d212" facs="#m-d4c91eef-9d55-4cdb-a447-420ba9d45493" label="lyrics-like">inquinátos sanctificat ad emunda¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c2cd42d-931a-4b11-8f1e-520a0c7b3ec9" facs="#m-e6f37028-4745-4af8-b992-b457ac004bf5" label="lyrics-like">sunt aetérnae haereditátis, in Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-d315c9fc-4c67-425b-bda9-5fe194b7ae6e" facs="#m-342dfa55-9a82-4ec1-b1fc-aafc4026c52f" label="lyrics-like">tiónem carnis; quanto magis san-sto Jesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-873d34f0-8ba4-4f49-aad1-4b3704d437e4" facs="#m-ca6cb496-a8a0-45d0-a9da-13b885e777d6" label="ambiguous">Grad.8</l><l xml:id="m-adf17d0a-3f62-46c1-bbe6-fbc469c56976" facs="#m-2a3d0082-5f44-454b-b399-41d229490f3f" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-33fd98d6-7f2c-4635-8588-2c5f55b0a030" facs="#m-43a20240-79b0-4c95-8efe-6101dd694326" label="lyrics-like">me“Dó-mi-ne,</l><l xml:id="m-313a321a-28e0-4bb1-a2b2-a33ed0ab5a88" facs="#m-5152ce7d-838b-40b6-a244-cc35c3180620" label="ambiguous">ri- pe</l><l xml:id="m-df4fe156-7064-4a3a-9878-3f3a392943f3" facs="#m-350b8193-54e7-41f2-860b-ac9ae34b2755" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-d5398d64-e2ed-4998-a664-16aebc722bb3" facs="#m-ef9398d3-287a-4276-b5f4-1a2a891695e3" label="ambiguous">de</l><l xml:id="m-76ee88a5-dcdf-4a4b-9150-389ab69da2ad" facs="#m-b70d7ca2-72e8-48b1-8dc4-bc65b7407466" label="ambiguous">=</l><l xml:id="m-42c6d7c9-8e6a-46cf-8d18-ee05fa8cd3f0" facs="#m-92bdfce1-2beb-4aff-9802-1142483334f2" label="lyrics-like">in-imí-cis mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d61f27c1-59db-4fdc-a36a-54cfc85db8a5" facs="#m-c75776d9-33fd-4b40-bffe-8695f350c957" label="text-like">is:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
